# Runtime / experiment logs (generated locally).
# Keep the ROS/colcon `log/` tree and the application's `logs/` archive
# separate on disk, but ignore both complete root-level trees.  The leading
# slash avoids hiding a source package that happens to contain a directory
# named `log` or `logs`.
/log/
/logs/

